# 2026-11-21 17:15:35.487247
+Write README.md now: a few short paragraphs only. Content: (1) what the program does — forecasts GTA VI trophy earn rates one week out as five quantiles per trophy; (2) the model — per-trophy trend of logit(rate) against ln(1+hours since release) fitted by weighted least squares on the case history, slope shrunk 65/35 toward a tier prior (platinum .55, gold .75, silver .90, bronze 1.00) and clamped to [-0.5, 2.5], saturation damping as rates approach 50+, caps for rare trophies, spread combining a 0.5*sqrt(horizon-days) random walk with the fit residuals; (3) files — main.py is the entrypoint, model.py holds the math; (4) validation note — the practice histories are the flat pre-refresh launch page, so practice validates format and runtime, not accuracy.

